# Env files

- Android release signing and gateway values: `apps/android/.env.example` (git-ignored; template in `apps/android/.env.template`). CI writes it from secrets.
- Gateway container: `temp.env` next to `docker-compose.yml` (written by the devops pipeline, git-ignored).
- Desktop app settings live in `~/Library/Application Support/Pairspan/settings.json`, not in the repo.

Never commit keystores, `GATEWAY_TOKEN`, ADB keys or device identifiers. The live token is the GitHub secret `GATEWAY_TOKEN`.
